{"id":"108030-44-bccd","year":108,"exam":"108年第一次專門職業及技術人員高等考試醫師牙醫師藥師考試分階段考試、醫事檢驗師、醫事放射師、物理治療師、職能治療師、呼吸治療師、獸醫師考試","level":"專技高考","subject":"微生物學與臨床微生物學（包括細菌與黴菌）","code":"4308","type":"測驗題","fixed":true,"classes":["醫事檢驗師"],"source":"https://wwwq.moex.gov.tw/exam/wHandExamQandA_File.ashx?t=Q&code=108030&c=308&s=44&q=1","essays":[],"mcq":[{"no":1,"q":"PYR hydrolysis test主要是偵測細菌之何種酵素活性？","opts":["pyocyanin synthase","pyorubin synthase","pyoverdin synthase","L-pyrrolidonyl aminopeptidase"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":2,"q":"下列何者為Proteus mirabilis的⽣化試驗結果？","opts":["ONPG (＋)","phenylalanine deaminase (＋)","H S (－)2","urease (－)"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":3,"q":"下列何種細菌的運動性試驗為陽性？","opts":["Enterobacter cloacae","Klebsiella pneumoniae","Shigella flexneri","Shigella sonnei"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":4,"q":"Bordetella pertussis最主要的分泌型virulence factor為何？","opts":["filamentous hemagglutinin","lipooligosaccharide","pertussis toxin","lipopolysaccharide"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":5,"q":"Urea breath test主要⽤於診斷下列何種細菌之感染？","opts":["Campylobacter coli","Helicobacter pylori","Arcobacter butzleri","Aeromonas hydrophila"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":6,"q":"有關汗斑（tinea versicolor）之致病菌，下列何者正確？","opts":["Microsporum spp.","Trichophyton spp.","Epidermophyton sp","Malassezia spp."],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":7,"q":"下列那個細菌天⽣具有⾃環境中獲取DNA的能⼒？","opts":["Escherichia coli","Neisseria gonorrhoeae","Staphylococcus aureus","Mycobacterium tuberculosis"],"ans":"A或B或C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":8,"q":"可利⽤lactose的細菌，通常也可利⽤下列那⼀種醣類？","opts":["glucose","mannose","xylose","arabinose"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":9,"q":"Voges-Proskauer（VP）反應是⽤於偵測下列那⼀個細菌代謝產物？","opts":["lactic acid","alcohol","acetic acid","acetoin"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":10,"q":"下列何者不是⼈類⼝腔對抗致病菌的主要保護機制？","opts":["IgG","saliva","l