？","opts":["葡萄糖（glucose）","乳糖（lactose）","⽢露醇（mannitol）","⽊蜜糖（xylose）"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":33,"q":"下列何種細菌在TSI agar中會產⽣hydrogen sulfide（H S）？2","opts":["遲鈍愛德華⽒菌（Edwardsiella tarda）","宋內志賀⽒桿菌（Shigella sonnei）","摩根⽒桿菌（Morganella morganii）","柯⽒檸檬酸桿菌（Citrobacter koseri）"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":34,"q":"下列何種⾰蘭⽒陰性菌在XLD培養基中呈現下圖之菌落型態？","opts":["傷寒沙⾨⽒桿菌（Salmonella Typhi）","沙雷⽒黏質桿菌（Serratia marcescens）","宋內志賀⽒桿菌（Shigella sonnei）","奇異變形桿菌（Proteus mirabilis）"],"fig":true,"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":35,"q":"下列何種特性可以區別⼤腸桿菌（E. coli）與創傷弧菌（Vibrio vulnificus）？","opts":["發酵乳糖","氧化酶（oxidase）","indole","⿃氨酸脫羧酶（ornithine decarboxylase）"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":36,"q":"下列何者培養基所含的指⽰劑與鑑定Neisseria spp.所⽤之CTA培養基的指⽰劑相同？","opts":["ornithine decarboxylase medium","Simmon’s citrate medium","triple sugar iron medium","Voges-Proskauer medium"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":37,"q":"感染奇異變形桿菌（Proteus mirabilis）容易造成患者腎結⽯，與該菌具有下列何者酵素有密切關係？","opts":["卵磷脂酶（lecithinase）","尿素酶（urease）","精胺酸雙⽔解酶（arginine dihydrolase）","離氨酸脫羧酶（lysine decarboxylase）"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":38,"q":"下列何種細菌在36℃具運動性？","opts":["肺炎克雷伯⽒菌（Klebsiella pneumoniae）","傷寒桿菌（Salmonella Typhi）","宋內志賀⽒桿菌（Shigella sonnei）","耶爾森結腸炎桿菌（Yersinia enterocolitica）"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":39,"q":"下列何種細菌可產⽣靈菌紅素（prodogiosin），且對於D-sorbitol具陽性反應？","opts":["克雷伯⽒肺炎桿菌（Klebsiella pneumoniae）","綠膿桿菌（Pseudomonas aeruginosa）","⼤腸桿菌O157:H7（E. coli O157:H7）","沙雷⽒黏質桿菌（Serratia marcescens）"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":40,"q":"下列何種細菌之nitrate reduction為陽性？","opts":["Moraxella catarrhalis","Neisseria lactamica","Neisseria gonorrhoeae","Neisseria meningitidis"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":41,"q":"下列Chlamydia trachomatis引起的疾病與其披衣菌亞型分類，何者正確？","opts":["砂眼－由A、B、Ba、C亞型引起","oculogenital infection－由L1、L2、L3亞型引起","花柳性淋巴⾁芽腫－由D、E、F、G、H、I、J、K八種亞型引起","鸚鵡熱－A、B、C亞型引起"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":42,"q":"有關Chlymydophila pneumoniae的敘述，下列何者錯誤？","opts":["只有⼀種⾎清型TWAR","其elementary body呈現梨形","與⼼⾎管疾病的發⽣可能有關","可引起鸚鵡熱"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":43,"q":"下列何種厭氧菌會引起偽膜性腸炎？","opts":["Clostridium perfringens","Clostridium difficile","Actinomyces israelii","Propionibacterium acnes"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":44,"q":"化療病患合併嚴重系統感染，較常⾒的厭氧菌感染為：","opts":["Fusobacterium nucleatum","Clostridium difficile","Bilophila sp","Prevotella spp."],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":45,"q":"以下厭氧菌與其選擇性培養基的配對，何者錯誤？","opts":["Clostridium difficile－CCFA","Bacteroides fragilis group－BBE","Porphyromonas spp.－KVLB","Clostridium perfringens－LD-egg yolk"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":46,"q":"在病理組織中觀察到sulfur granules，推測可能感染下列何種病原菌？","opts":["Actinomyces israelii","Propionibacterium acnes","Clostridium difficile","Clostridium perfringens"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":47,"q":"以分⼦檢測法偵測糞便中的Clostridium difficile，主要是檢測下列何種毒性基因？","opts":["GDH","tcdB","cdtA","cdtB"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":48,"q":"下列何種⽅法不適合⽤來檢測螺旋菌？","opts":["暗視野顯微鏡","⾎清免疫法","分⼦檢測法","⾰蘭⽒染⾊法"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":49,"q":"下列何者為黴漿菌的關節液檢體傳送條件？","opts":["1⼩時內以4℃條件運送","加絕對酒精保存室溫運送","加入penicillin類藥物的選擇性培養基","加入L-cysteine及hemin的選擇性培養基"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":50,"q":"⾦黃⾊葡萄球菌（Staphylococcus aureus）可藉由獲得何種抗藥基因，對oxacillin產⽣抗藥性？","opts":["fosA","ermA","vanA","mecA"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":51,"q":"培養真菌時使⽤Rice medium，有助於達到下列何種⽬的？","opts":["可區別Microsporum canis及Microsporum audouinii","含有polysorbate 80會抑制Candida albicans形成chlamydospore","營養豐富，所有真菌均可⽣⻑良好","適合進⾏真菌之藥物感受性試驗"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":52,"q":"下列何種抗⽣素的作⽤機制為抑制topoisomerase II（DNA gyrase）的功能？","opts":["ciprofloxacin","vancomycin","tetracycline","rifampin"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":53,"q":"引起⽪膚真菌病（dermatophytosis）的Trichophyton、Microsporum及Epidermophyton菌屬具有下列何種共同特性？","opts":["嗜⾼溫（thermophilic）","嗜⾓質素（keratinophilic）","雙形性（dimorphic）","嗜脂性（lipophilic）"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":54,"q":"當兩種抗⽣素合併使⽤的效能⼤於分別使⽤，稱之為：","opts":["相加效應（additive effect）","加乘效應（synergistic effect）","拮抗效應（antagonistic effect）","無影響（indifference）"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":55,"q":"下列何種抗⽣素屬於抑制細菌⽣⻑的抑菌劑（bacteriostatic agent）？","opts":["vancomycin","daptomycin","rifampin","tetracycline"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":56,"q":"下列何種抗⽣素不常⽤於治療肺結核桿菌（Mycobacterium tuberculosis）的感染？","opts":["streptomycin","rifampin","ethionamide","vancomycin"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":57,"q":"下列何種抗⽣素的殺菌機制是透過破壞細菌的細胞膜？","opts":["vancomycin","colistin","daptomycin","rifampin"],"ans":"B或C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":58,"q":"在紙錠擴散法（disk diffusion method）中，測定enterococci的何種抗⽣素需培養24⼩時？","opts":["rifampin","ciprofloxacin","gentamicin","vancomycin"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":59,"q":"在培養液稀釋法（broth dilution susceptibility test）中，偵測methicillin-resistant staphylococci需於Mueller-Hinton培養基中額外添加何物？","opts":["2% NaCl","2% MgCl2","5% NaCl","5% MgCl2"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":60,"q":"厭氧菌對下列何種抗⽣素具有天然抗性（intrinsic resistance）？","opts":["kanamycin","penicillin","levofloxacin","rifampin"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":61,"q":"下列何種⽅法可輔助判斷⼄型鏈球菌（group B streptococcus）是否具有誘導型clindamycin抗藥性？","opts":["modified Hodge test","Drigalski agar test","nitrocefin-based test","D zone test"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":62,"q":"有關百⽇咳患者之檢體採集與培養，下列何者正確？","opts":["使⽤棉棒拭⼦採集，因為內含的脂肪酸對菌體⽣⻑有益","採集喉部檢體","採集⿐咽部檢體","接種於MacConkey agar"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":63,"q":"下列何種菌常造成食物中毒？","opts":["Vibrio parahaemolyticus","Haemophilus parahaemolyticus","Bordetella parapertussis","Haemophilus parainfluenzae"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":64,"q":"下列何者不是幽⾨桿菌（Helicobacter pylori）之毒⼒（virulence）相關基因？","opts":["vacA","cagA","iceA","mecA"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":65,"q":"下列何菌最常引起孩童中⽿炎（otitis media）？","opts":["Streptococcus pneumoniae","Streptococcus agalactiae","Streptococcus bovis","Streptococcus mutans"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":66,"q":"下列關於Propionibacterium acnes之敘述，何者錯誤？","opts":["⼈體⽪膚常在菌，常造成⾎液培養之污染","厭氧⾰蘭⽒陰性不產孢桿菌","可引起⽪膚的痤瘡（acne）","可引起亞急性⼼內膜炎（subacute bacterial endocarditis）"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":67,"q":"下列何種孢⼦屬於黴菌之無性⽣殖？","opts":["ascospore","sporangiospore","zygospore","oospore"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":68,"q":"有關黴菌的vegetative reproduction，下列何種型態的conidia非直接來⾃vegetative mycelium？","opts":["basidioconidia","chlamydoconidia","arthroconidia","blastoconidia"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":69,"q":"下列何種抗黴菌藥物可影響ergosterol之合成？①amphotericin B②itraconazole③fluconazole④flucytosine","opts":["僅①②","僅②③","僅①③④","僅③④"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":70,"q":"下列何種黴菌所引起的真菌性菌⾜病（Eumycotic mycetoma），其組織有⿊⾊顆粒出現，孢⼦有多個細胞（以4個為主），中間的細胞較末端膨⼤⽽⿊，使整個孢⼦形狀彎曲？","opts":["Phialophora cyanescens","Aspergillus nidulans","Curvularia lunata","Pleurostomophora ochracea"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":71,"q":"下列何種試驗可以區分⽩⾊念珠菌與新型隱球菌？","opts":["glucose assimilation test","KNO utilization test3","lactose fermentation test","inositol assimilation test"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":72,"q":"下列酵⺟菌中，何者urease呈陽性反應？","opts":["Candida tropicalis","Cryptococcus neoformans","Candida glabrata","Candida parapsilosis"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":73,"q":"下列那個培養基中含醣的種類最多？","opts":["MacConkey agar","eosin-methylene blue（EMB）agar","xylose-lysine-deoxycholate（XLD）agar","Salmonella-Shigella（SS）agar"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":74,"q":"下列何者不屬於bipartite exotoxin（A-B subunits）？","opts":["pertussis toxins","E.coli heat-labile enterotoxins","Shiga toxins","staphylococcal heat-stable enterotoxins"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":75,"q":"下列何種細菌不會分解esculin？","opts":["Enterococcus faecalis","Streptococcus bovis","Streptococcus pyogenes","Listeria monocytogenes"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":76,"q":"多重抗藥性肺結核桿菌是指對下列那兩種抗⽣素呈現抗藥性？","opts":["kanamycin及quinolone","rifampin及kanamycin","rifampin及isoniazid","quinolone及isoniazid"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":77,"q":"70歲住院病患經⻑期使⽤抗⽣素後，開始持續發⽣連續腹瀉的病徵，最有可能是何種病原菌所引起？","opts":["Clostridium difficile","Salmonella spp.","Shigella spp.","Campylobacter spp."],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":78,"q":"⾎液培養出厭氧菌，⾰蘭⽒染⾊為GPB，可選擇下列何種培養基進⾏菌種鑑定？","opts":["LD presumpto agar","KVLB agar","BBE agar","chocolate agar"],"ans":"A","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":79,"q":"臺灣中部某⼩學數名學童先後在5⽇內發⽣下痢的事件，症狀包含腹瀉、發燒、嘔吐、裏急後重（tenesmus）。由病童的糞便中及該校洗⼿⽤的地下⽔中，分離出⼀株不會發酵乳糖、無運動性之腸內桿菌科（Enterobacteriaceae）細菌。衛⽣單位對病童施以居家隔離，學校環境進⾏消毒後，疫情幸未再擴⼤。下列菌屬中，何者最有可能是造成此次事件的元兇？","opts":["埃希⽒菌屬（Escherichia）","沙⾨⽒菌屬（Salmonella）","志賀⽒菌屬（Shigella）","耶爾辛⽒菌屬（Yersinia）"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":80,"q":"承上題，下列有關此菌屬的敘述，何者錯誤？","opts":["能造成吞噬細胞之凋亡（apoptosis）","⼈類是其唯⼀的儲主（reservoir）","易侵入病⼈⾎液，造成敗⾎症（sepsis）","常藉由污染的⽔源或食物散播"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]}],"answer":"https://wwwq.moex.gov.tw/exam/wHandExamQandA_File.ashx?t=M&code=108030&c=308&s=44&q=1"}